int raw token; hash; insert row; resolve hash → `user_id`. |\n| `server/auth/users.py` | Create user; fetch by id/username; map row → `UserObj` dict. |\n| `server/auth/deps.py` | `get_current_user` FastAPI dependency; 401 envelope helper. |\n| `server/auth/routes.py` | `APIRouter` with register / login / me. |\n| `server/errors.py` | Small helper to build `JSONResponse` error envelopes (shared). |\n| `tests/test_auth.py` | Contract tests: register 201, duplicate 409, validation 400, login 200/401, me 200/401, cross-DB identity (same sqlite path / TestClient). |\n\n### Modify\n\n| File | Change |\n|------|--------|\n| `server/db.py` | Add `migrate(conn)` / `ensure_schema(sqlite_path)` applying version 1 DDL; keep existing bootstrap. Prefer a list of `(version, sql_callable)` migrations. Expose `connect(sqlite_path) -> Connection` used by auth (WAL pragmas every time). |\n| `server/app.py` | Call full schema ensure on lifespan (not only bootstrap); `include_router` auth routes; leave `/api/health` and stub `GET /` unchanged. |\n| `requirements.txt` | **No new dependencies required** if using stdlib crypto + uuid. Do not add Redis usage for auth. |\n| `tests/test_health.py` | Only if lifespan/migration changes break bootstrap assertions — keep health unauthenticated; do not weaken existing checks. |\n\n### Do not touch\n\n| File | Reason |\n|------|--------|\n| `start.sh` | Supervisor already shares `HUDDLE_DATA_DIR`; no auth-specific change |\n| `server/settings.py` | Already exposes sqlite path |\n| `timer.sh`, `loom-prompts/**` | Harness |\n| SPA / `GET /` HTML | MARATHON-16 |\n| Profile PATCH routes | MARATHON-4 |\n\n## Sequencing and Cross-Task Seams\n\n### Build order (single implementer)\n\n1. `server/errors.py` + `db.py` migration v1.\n2. `passwords.py` / `tokens.py` / `users.py`.\n3. `deps.py` + `routes.py`.\n4. Wire `app.py`.\n5. `tests/test_auth.py` + manual three-port check.\n\nParallelism: password helpers and error helper can proceed in parallel; routes depend on both + migration.\n\n### Downstream seams this task owns\n\n| Contract | Consumed by |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `UserObj` JSON shape | MARATHON-4 (Profiles), MARATHON-5+ (owner/member displays), MARATHON-16 (SPA session user) |\n| Bearer + `get_cur\n---BUILD---\nBuild order (single implementer)\n\n1. `server/errors.py` + `db.py` migration v1.\n2. `passwords.py` / `tokens.py` / `users.py`.\n3. `deps.py` + `routes.py`.\n4. Wire `app.py`.\n5. `tests/test_auth.py` + manual three-port check.\n\nParallelism: password helpers and error helper can proceed in parallel; routes depend on both + migration.\n\n### Downstream seams this task owns\n\n| Contract | Consumed by |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `UserObj` JSON shape | MARATHON-4 (Profiles), MARATHON-5+ (owner/member displays), MARATHON-16 (SPA session user) |\n| Bearer + `get_current_user` | MARATHON-4, 5, 10, and all authenticated APIs |\n| Error envelope `{error:{code,message}}` | All subsequent REST tasks + SPA error rendering |\n| `users` / `auth_tokens` tables | Profiles (updates same row); no second users table\nfba2eb6 Scaffold Huddle cluster: start.sh, FastAPI nodes, Redis (MARATHON-2)\nlrwxrwxrwx. 1 root root 10 Aug 22 22:25 /work/ws/worktrees/app/backend-dev-1/.venv/bin/python -> python3.12\nfastapi>=0.115.0,<1.0.0\nuvicorn[standard]>=0.32.0,<1.0.0\nredis>=5.0.0,<6.0.0\nhttpx>=0.27.0,<1.0.0\npytest>=8.0.0,<9.0.0\n","stderr":"","executionTime":151,"interleavedOutput":"## Files to Create / Files to Modify\n\n### Create\n\n| File | Change |\n|------|--------|\n| `server/auth/__init__.py` | Package marker; optionally re-export router + `get_current_user`. |\n| `server/auth/passwords.py` | Hash / verify helpers (`scrypt`). |\n| `server/auth/tokens.py` | Mint raw token; hash; insert row; resolve hash → `user_id`. |\n| `server/auth/users.py` | Create user; fetch by id/username; map row → `UserObj` dict. |\n| `server/auth/deps.py` | `get_current_user` FastAPI dependency; 401 envelope helper. |\n| `serv