ex, claude, opencode). Env: LOOM_BACKEND\n      --log-format string   Log format (text|json) (default \"text\")\n      --log-output string   Log output destination (stderr|<filepath>) (default \"stderr\")\n  -o, --output string       Output format: text|json (default \"text\")\n      --server string       Loom server base URL (or LOOM_SERVER_URL env var)\n      --workspace string    Workspace ID. Env: LOOM_WORKSPACE\nstatus in_progress labels ['architect', 'backend', 'needs-revision']\nors:** 401; 404 `not_found` if slug missing **or** caller not a member (same message, e.g. `\"workspace not found\"` — do not leak invite-only existence).\n\n### Validation envelope scope (modify `server/errors.py`)\n\n`RequestValidationError` → 400 envelope for **any** path starting with `/api/` except exact `/api/health`. Keeps SPA/grader on one error shape for workspaces and future routes.\n\n## Data Model\n\n### Migration version 2 (additive, backward compatible)\n\nApplied after v1 (`users`, `auth_tokens`). Record `schema_migrations.version=2`.\n\n#### `workspaces`\n\n| Column | Type | Null | Notes |\n|--------|------|------|-------|\n| `id` | TEXT | NOT NULL | PK, UUID4 |\n| `slug` | TEXT | NOT NULL | UNIQUE |\n| `name` | TEXT | NOT NULL | |\n| `owner_id` | TEXT | NOT NULL | FK → `users.id` |\n| `join_mode` | TEXT | NOT NULL | CHECK IN (`open`,`invite_only`); default `open` |\n| `created_at` | TEXT | NOT NULL | UTC Z |\n| `updated_at` | TEXT | NOT NULL | UTC Z |\n\n#### `workspace_members`\n\n| Column | Typ\n---NOTES---\nDesign complete for Workspaces create/list/detail + auto #general. Keeps backend label for implementer after architect approval. Establishes WorkspaceObj, ChannelObj seed, migration v2 (workspaces/members/channels/read_state). Blocks MARATHON-6/7/16.\n","stderr":"time=2026-08-22T22:54:22.125Z level=INFO msg=\"opened existing embedded fleet-db client\" url=http://127.0.0.1:44829\ntime=2026-08-22T22:54:22.253Z level=INFO msg=\"opened existing embedded fleet-db cli